{"name": "Spin Tide", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"90\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/d811d74a29822fa68e7877bfd0c46d5b.avif?t=1794317561\" width=\"1170\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"680\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/303b7cd6888a6f6192672b0cc18733f6.poster.avif?t=1794317561\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/303b7cd6888a6f6192672b0cc18733f6.webm?t=1794317561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/303b7cd6888a6f6192672b0cc18733f6.mp4?t=1794317561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a lone wind turbine in a sea ruled by oil-guzzling giants, and you\u2019re about to ruin their day. Blow them out of the water. Fry them with lightning. Blast them with a foghorn, then bury them under a tidal wave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"90\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/325b3bf8e51e76fe8ef3b00ebb2658a1.avif?t=1794317561\" width=\"1170\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"680\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/80aa6fd3859e7faedf4a5f46f3222069.poster.avif?t=1794317561\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/80aa6fd3859e7faedf4a5f46f3222069.webm?t=1794317561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/80aa6fd3859e7faedf4a5f46f3222069.mp4?t=1794317561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow from a bobbing underdog into a floating powerhouse, bristling with every part a turbine was never meant to have: call in a whole wind farm or ring the bell for the Kraken. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"90\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/6190858f7d0600027da403fe47836f2c.avif?t=1794317561\" width=\"1170\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"680\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/4e3e2d320c9eaca69cfc28696f6c58b1.poster.avif?t=1794317561\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/4e3e2d320c9eaca69cfc28696f6c58b1.webm?t=1794317561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5288040/extras/4e3e2d320c9eaca69cfc28696f6c58b1.mp4?t=1794317561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fog, coral, ice floes and alligators: four unique seas brimming with pirates and real big baddies. Face off against giant oil tankers, floating pirate fortresses and many more. Make them regret picking a fight.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Spin to win in this open-sea survivors-like where a lone wind turbine becomes a force of nature. Stack wild upgrades into game-breaking builds, turn oil-guzzling pirate hordes into driftwood and defy colossal oil tankers to clean up the seas one spin at a time.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a